formance timing depends on the specific CSUB event program.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csub-fight-song","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"CSUB Fight Song","title":"Learn the Other CSUB Song","subtitle":"The university pairs its athletic fight song with the Alma Mater","notes":"Use the university’s anniversary listening link to learn the Fight Song, then listen for it when Roadrunner spirit programming or athletics calls for it.","short_summary":"CSUB treats memorizing the Fight Song as an act of Runner participation, distinct from singing the formal Alma Mater.","evidence_claim":"In its official 50th-anniversary celebration list, CSUB instructed its community to listen to—and try to memorize—the CSUB Alma Mater and Fight Song.","source_url":"https://csub.edu/50/50-ways-celebrate-50th-anniversary.shtml","source_title":"50 Ways to Celebrate the 50th Anniversary | California State University, Bakersfield","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The university page provides a public listening link; where and when the song is performed depends on the athletics or spirit event.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"csub-expression-nights","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Expression Nights","title":"Take the Mic in Any Art Form","subtitle":"Songs, poems, verses, and other performances share one CSUB stage","notes":"Watch Campus Programming’s calendar, register if performers are asked to sign up, and prepare a short piece suited to the announced theme.","short_summary":"Expression Nights gives CSUB students a recurring, flexible showcase where the medium can change with each performer.","evidence_claim":"CSUB lists Expression Nights among Campus Programming’s traditional events and says students may express their talents through song, verse, poetry, or another art form